Chants of “Haley, Haley, Haley” break out at Mike Rogers final campaign rally in Rochester Hills, MI. 

Sparked by a member of the “Democrats for Rogers” group thanking Haley Stevens on stage. Loudest applause of the night by far. 

@NewsNation

Haley Stevens knew that endorsing Mike Rogers would mean the end of her career in the Democratic Party. She knew that her colleagues and so-called allies would turn on her. And she did it anyway.

She looked at the candidate her party chose and saw someone who has built his political career on demonizing America and Israel and excusing terrorism.

@HaleyforMI chose her country and her conscience over party loyalty and political ambition. I have nothing but deep respect for her.
